ms of communication available from the app such as direct SMS, Email and Client Request function by clicking on the Icon on the top right.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"696\"><br data-identifyelement=\"697\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"698\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082346193/original/5ptR3ckEkAZ13o3i4Gsv2HyoFUuzUqIXaA.png?1563897592\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082346193/original/5ptR3ckEkAZ13o3i4Gsv2HyoFUuzUqIXaA.png?1563897592\" data-fileid=\"9082346193\" data-uniquekey=\"1563897263115\" data-identifyelement=\"699\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"700\"><br data-identifyelement=\"701\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"702\"><a data-identifyelement=\"703\" href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/66ace37862fa4b048addd8de9c4f5200\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch a walk-through of Capium Hub</a></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172858\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172858/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172858\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172858/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-f